70
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:27,220
EPISODE 33:
THE RESULT OF THE TOKYO TOURNAMENT

71
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:25,180
The first half wasn't that bad.

72
00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:27,930
Don't worry about Misugi scoring.

73
00:03:27,930 --> 00:03:31,840
In the second half, we'll implement the anti-Misugi tactic; Sawada will constantly mark him.

74
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,690
Okay!

75
00:03:32,690 --> 00:03:37,190
Wait a second, Coach, let me mark Misugi.

76
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:42,240
I'll make him pay in the second half; I'll take the ball from him and pass through all of them.

77
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,200
Calm down, Hyuga.

78
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:47,180
Football is a team game.

79
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:49,870
You should just do the task given to you.

80
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:56,130
As the central forward, you'll stay up front and wait for a counter-attack.

81
00:03:56,130 --> 00:03:59,990
If you get fixated on something in your head, you can't expect to play well.

82
00:03:59,990 --> 00:04:01,730
Do you understand, Hyuga?

83
00:04:01,730 --> 00:04:02,630
Yes.

84
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:04,360
Damn it!

85
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,880
He's right. Football is a team competition...

86
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:11,190
But individual play is also important!

87
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:14,520
What kind of match is this?

88
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:21,350
Hyuga, our goal is to prevent Nankatsu from being champions for the 3rd time in the Traditional Tournament.

89
00:04:21,350 --> 00:04:24,800
To achieve that, we must win this match.

90
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,660
Please...

91
00:04:27,180 --> 00:04:28,790
I know that very well, Takeshi.

92
00:04:28,790 --> 00:04:29,790
Hyuga...

93
00:04:32,820 --> 00:04:35,590
We conceded 3 goals in the first half, but now we are pressing.

94
00:04:35,590 --> 00:04:37,490
Keep it up in the second half!

95
00:04:37,490 --> 00:04:38,130
Yes!

96
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:42,610
And Misugi, you will only play until the 20th minute.

97
00:04:42,610 --> 00:04:44,120
I know.

98
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:46,520
We'll handle the rest after that, Misugi!

99
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:48,590
Let's win and go to the traditional tournament!

100
00:04:48,590 --> 00:04:49,360
Yes!

101
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,140
Guys!

102
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:54,310
20 more minutes...

103
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:57,310
The players of both teams have come out onto the field.

104
00:04:58,020 --> 00:05:01,820
Toho Academy finished the first half leading 3-1,

105
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:05,070
but thanks to Misugi, the direction of the match has changed.

106
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:08,070
Will Toho be able to protect the score?

107
00:05:08,820 --> 00:05:11,950
We can't even predict the end of the match!

108
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:15,080
The second half will begin with Musashi Middle School's kick-off!

109
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:20,430
The ball is with Misugi!

110
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:23,590
Misugi has been creating positions single-handedly since the first half.

111
00:05:23,590 --> 00:05:27,300
Sawada immediately moves to take the ball from Misugi.

112
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:33,060
We can't let Misugi move freely.

113
00:05:33,060 --> 00:05:33,560
Suzuki!

114
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,080
Misugi is passing the ball around.

115
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,810
Everything is going well.

116
00:05:42,900 --> 00:05:45,130
Musashi is passing the ball in their own half.

117
00:05:45,130 --> 00:05:47,660
They haven't even stepped into the opponent's half.

118
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:50,280
Come on, I'll guard here and then counter-attack.

119
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,830
I'll make you concede a goal for the ball you stole from me.

120
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:54,330
Captain!

121
00:05:54,330 --> 00:05:56,160
The ball is with Misugi again.

122
00:05:56,950 --> 00:05:59,540
But Sawada is right behind him, following him.

123
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:01,630
It seems they won't let him dribble.

124
00:06:01,630 --> 00:06:02,520
If that's the case...

125
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:04,340
A long pass from Misugi.

126
00:06:04,340 --> 00:06:05,410
Okay.

127
00:06:05,410 --> 00:06:08,130
Will Musashi be able to score?

128
00:06:08,130 --> 00:06:09,640
You're too naive!

129
00:06:10,940 --> 00:06:14,720
But goalkeeper Wakashimazu jumps and catches the ball.

130
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:17,730
Toho is as good as I expected.

131
00:06:20,150 --> 00:06:21,360
Come on!

132
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:24,780
Toho's ace player Hyuga runs forward.

133
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:26,490
It's their turn for a counter-attack!

134
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:28,030
Captain!

135
00:06:29,030 --> 00:06:29,740
Got it!

136
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:37,180
Offside!

137
00:06:37,180 --> 00:06:38,280
What...?

138
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:41,750
Musashi and Misugi's favorite thing, the offside tactic!

139
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:42,790
Damn it!

140
00:06:42,790 --> 00:06:44,400
The game is continuing fiercely!

141
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,460
Both the forwards and the defenses are highly ambitious!

142
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:50,430
Misugi is taking advantage of Sawada's gap

143
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:52,970
and a goal chance for Musashi...

144
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:58,220
But again Wakashimazu, again Wakashimazu!

145
00:06:58,220 --> 00:07:00,140
Great save, Wakashimazu!

146
00:07:02,460 --> 00:07:06,480
Thanks to their offside traps, Musashi didn't give Toho a chance to score.

147
00:07:07,130 --> 00:07:08,110
Damn it!

148
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:13,530
Neither team could turn their positions into goals; every passing second is very crucial right now.

149
00:07:15,050 --> 00:07:17,560
Even though we're attacking this much, we can't score!

150
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:20,210
It's almost time to take Misugi out of the game.

151
00:07:20,210 --> 00:07:22,210
The time is almost up.

152
00:07:22,210 --> 00:07:25,210
We can't push him this hard.

153
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:34,230
I have to score one more goal and bring the gap down to one!

154
00:07:35,700 --> 00:07:37,680
Wakashimazu is a famous goalkeeper.

155
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:42,190
If I can't create a good position like the first goal, I can't score.

156
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:43,270
Honma!

157
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:45,160
A short pass from Misugi.

158
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:47,070
Will they advance with a 1-2 tactic?

159
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:48,820
It won't work, Misugi!

160
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:51,400
Take this!

161
00:07:52,870 --> 00:07:53,700
Okay!

162
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:56,230
Wakashimazu fell into the trap!

163
00:07:56,230 --> 00:07:58,700
The ball goes to Sanada!

164
00:07:58,700 --> 00:08:00,040
Got it!

165
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:02,160
A certain goal chance!

166
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:04,420
As if I'll allow it!

167
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:07,500
But that didn't work either!

168
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:09,800
Wakashimazu punches the ball away!

169
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,130
Alright, that's it!

170
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:16,350
Misugi is running towards the ball!

171
00:08:16,350 --> 00:08:20,440
I have to hit the ball while it's in the air before Sawada catches up.

172
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:21,350
And for that...

173
00:08:21,930 --> 00:08:23,600
This is my only chance!

174
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:33,400
Misugi jumps while running and goes for an overhead kick!

175
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,360
What?!

176
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:38,410
Go!

177
00:08:38,410 --> 00:08:39,410
Captain!

178
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:43,540
Wakashimazu still hasn't regained his balance!

179
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:44,670
Wakashimazu!

180
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:47,670
Do you think you can score another goal against me?

181
00:08:51,090 --> 00:08:52,270
The ball is in the net!

182
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:55,140
Misugi scores his second goal against Wakashimazu!

183
00:08:55,140 --> 00:08:56,220
Damn it!

184
00:08:58,220 --> 00:09:00,000
You did it, Captain!

185
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:00,720
Alright!

186
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:03,460
Misugi is still impressive.

187
00:09:03,460 --> 00:09:06,520
He performed an incredible overhead kick and there it is!

188
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:07,480
The second goal!

189
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:10,950
He sent the ball to the right corner with an incredible shot.

190
00:09:10,950 --> 00:09:12,490
I did it!

191
00:09:13,990 --> 00:09:15,840
You did it, Misugi!

192
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,630
The gap is finally down to one!

193
00:09:19,420 --> 00:09:20,580
Captain!

194
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:21,490
Captain!

195
00:09:21,490 --> 00:09:24,700
Oh no! We've exceeded Misugi's 30-minute limit!

196
00:09:24,700 --> 00:09:26,230
Nishiyama, I'm putting you in right away.

197
00:09:26,230 --> 00:09:27,080
Okay.

198
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,960
Please wait, Coach!

199
00:09:30,150 --> 00:09:31,260
Captain...

200
00:09:34,970 --> 00:09:37,490
I'm fine. I can still play.

201
00:09:39,050 --> 00:09:40,810
Captain...

202
00:09:41,260 --> 00:09:42,640
One more goal...

203
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:45,880
At least let me try.

204
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:48,540
Please, give me one more chance.

205
00:09:48,540 --> 00:09:49,480
But Misugi...

206
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,400
I'm fine.

207
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:56,990
I rested enough during the break; I know my body best.

208
00:09:57,820 --> 00:10:00,480
One last chance...

209
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,620
Misugi...

210
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:03,620
I beg you, Coach!

211
00:10:05,190 --> 00:10:06,250
Alright.

212
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:10,920
Thank you very much, Coach.

213
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:18,350
I thought Musashi would take Misugi out at the end of 30 minutes. I was wrong.

214
00:10:18,350 --> 00:10:20,980
Misugi will continue to play.

215
00:10:20,980 --> 00:10:22,300
What does this mean?

216
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:25,270
How can he ignore what I said!

217
00:10:25,270 --> 00:10:27,860
It's too dangerous for him to play any longer.

218
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:32,190
Please, Doctor, let him play!

219
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:38,320
The captain underwent a very rigorous 2-year rehabilitation to play in this tournament.

220
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:42,620
He gave up everything to be able to play in this tournament.

221
00:10:43,290 --> 00:10:45,790
Only this way could he play against Tsubasa once more.

222
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:47,660
Tsubasa...

223
00:10:48,910 --> 00:10:51,130
Doctor, I beg you!

224
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:53,380
You...

225
00:10:54,180 --> 00:10:55,710
What's wrong, Kojiro?

226
00:10:55,710 --> 00:11:00,180
You were only playing properly when Misugi wasn't in the game.

227
00:11:00,780 --> 00:11:06,060
Misugi scored 2 goals in 30 minutes, but you scored 3 goals in 50 minutes.

228
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:11,460
You're losing your battle against Misugi, Kojiro.

229
00:11:11,460 --> 00:11:12,560
Damn it!

230
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:14,680
He can't go on like this.

231
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:18,490
If Misugi keeps playing, they'll keep up the pressure.

232
00:11:18,490 --> 00:11:21,660
If that's the case, we need to score one more goal.

233
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:23,240
Sawada, go on the attack!

234
00:11:24,410 --> 00:11:27,840
Hyuga, the Coach signaled for me to join the attack.

235
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,290
Let's score one more goal then.

236
00:11:29,290 --> 00:11:30,460
Let's do it.

237
00:11:31,370 --> 00:11:33,710
My football consists only of attack.

238
00:11:33,710 --> 00:11:35,840
Football is all about attacking.

239
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:38,320
Don't get cocky, Misugi.

240
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,900
I'll show you how football is played.

241
00:11:40,900 --> 00:11:45,900
~Anime Severler~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

242
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:53,020
The gap is down to one.

243
00:11:53,020 --> 00:11:57,610
And Sawada has moved back to forward.

244
00:12:00,190 --> 00:12:03,530
I'm counting on you... Captain, Takeshi.

245
00:12:05,250 --> 00:12:06,560
Let's go, Takeshi!

246
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,400
Yes.

247
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:10,960
Toho Academy is attacking with Hyuga and Sawada!

248
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:14,330
Will Musashi be able to stop the attack?

249
00:12:14,330 --> 00:12:17,920
Come on, guys! Let's stop them and tie the score!

250
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:18,590
Okay!

251
00:12:22,210 --> 00:12:24,820
Two Musashi players are trying to steal the ball!

252
00:12:24,820 --> 00:12:26,510
Will he pass to Sawada?

253
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:29,010
I'm enough for you all by myself!

254
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,760
He broke through them!

255
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:35,850
Has Hyuga's furious spirit returned?

256
00:12:35,850 --> 00:12:37,520
I'm coming, Musashi!

257
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:43,360
If I bring the ball myself, your offside trap won't work!

258
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:45,440
I'll mark Hyuga.

259
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:48,440
When I get the ball, we'll make a quick counter-attack!

260
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:48,910
Yes!

261
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:55,330
Hyuga and Misugi finally engage in a one-on-one battle!

262
00:12:55,940 --> 00:12:59,840
This is what I wanted! Come, Misugi!

263
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,480
Come at me, Hyuga!

264
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:04,840
If I can stop you, we can tie the score!

265
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:16,980
Misugi is running alongside Hyuga.

266
00:13:16,980 --> 00:13:18,730
The ball is still with Hyuga.

267
00:13:18,730 --> 00:13:21,360
There is a very ambitious struggle between them!

268
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:30,120
Will Hyuga be able to get inside?

269
00:13:30,750 --> 00:13:33,000
Or will Misugi take the ball?

270
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:35,460
Come on, Hyuga!

271
00:13:35,460 --> 00:13:37,460
Misugi!

272
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:45,510
It seems Hyuga isn't thinking of passing.

273
00:13:45,510 --> 00:13:47,130
Hyuga...

274
00:13:47,810 --> 00:13:50,090
Damn it, I can't shake him off!

275
00:13:50,090 --> 00:13:51,420
What kind of man is this?!

276
00:13:51,420 --> 00:13:52,220
I'm passing!

277
00:13:53,740 --> 00:13:54,220
I'll stop you--

278
00:13:58,380 --> 00:13:59,060
Misugi!

279
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:00,060
Captain!

280
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:00,940
Misugi!

281
00:14:00,940 --> 00:14:01,690
Misugi!

282
00:14:02,180 --> 00:14:04,760
What's happening to Misugi?!

283
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:07,700
He suddenly fell while battling shoulder-to-shoulder with Hyuga!

284
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:10,490
Guys...

285
00:14:13,540 --> 00:14:14,500
What?!

286
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:18,420
Misugi clears the ball and collapses to the ground!

287
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:19,410
Alright!

288
00:14:19,410 --> 00:14:21,710
Musashi gets the ball!

289
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:25,340
Everyone is following Misugi's order!

290
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:26,630
Make a very fast counter-attack!

291
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:27,420
Okay!

292
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:29,760
A counter-attack from Musashi!

293
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:32,810
Toho is quickly returning to defense!

294
00:14:32,810 --> 00:14:34,180
Everyone who can, get back on defense!

295
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:36,930
This is a chance Misugi prepared for us.

296
00:14:36,930 --> 00:14:40,230
A chance he risked his life to prepare.

297
00:14:40,230 --> 00:14:44,730
We'll follow Misugi's orders and score the goal!

298
00:14:45,140 --> 00:14:46,240
Bring it on, rookies!

299
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:49,570
As if I'll let anyone other than Misugi score!

300
00:14:49,570 --> 00:14:52,740
This could be the fateful moment of the match.

301
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:55,120
5 minutes left.

302
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:59,120
The excitement is at its peak!

303
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,370
Sanada!

304
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:01,630
Honma!

305
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:03,620
Here it goes!

306
00:15:03,620 --> 00:15:07,050
Musashi's combined passing traffic without controlling the ball...

307
00:15:07,050 --> 00:15:09,170
A long shot against Wakashimazu won't work!

308
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:12,550
We'll get as close to the goal as we can,

309
00:15:12,550 --> 00:15:17,640
create a good position, and then take the shot.

310
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:18,310
Okay!

311
00:15:18,310 --> 00:15:23,310
Musashi's forward line advances as if Misugi's fighting spirit has passed onto them!

312
00:15:23,770 --> 00:15:26,470
Toho's defense can't do anything!

313
00:15:26,470 --> 00:15:27,570
What are you doing?!

314
00:15:27,570 --> 00:15:30,740
Musashi is one-on-one with the goalkeeper!

315
00:15:30,740 --> 00:15:32,070
Come at me!

316
00:15:32,070 --> 00:15:33,700
I'm leaving it to you, Honma!

317
00:15:33,700 --> 00:15:37,420
Musashi's final pass is on its way.

318
00:15:37,420 --> 00:15:39,420
It'll be a goal.

319
00:15:39,420 --> 00:15:40,960
A perfect chance.

320
00:15:42,500 --> 00:15:48,840
I, Ken Wakashimazu, will quit football if I let you score!

321
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:51,250
Wakashimazu runs forward with ambition!

322
00:15:51,250 --> 00:15:54,550
But Honma is ready to strike!

323
00:15:54,550 --> 00:15:56,550
I'll handle it!

324
00:15:58,470 --> 00:15:59,310
What?!

325
00:16:01,910 --> 00:16:04,020
This—

326
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:09,560
He stopped it! Wakashimazu!

327
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:11,140
You did it, Wakashimazu!

328
00:16:11,140 --> 00:16:12,360
He blocked it!

329
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:15,980
After his crazy dash, he stopped it with both hands.

330
00:16:15,980 --> 00:16:19,910
He pushed his stamina to the limit!

331
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:21,460
Wakashimazu!

332
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:26,600
While Musashi was utilizing the chance Misugi gave them very well,

333
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:31,250
Wakashimazu stepped up and said he wouldn't let this goal in.

334
00:16:31,250 --> 00:16:33,130
And he did what he said!

335
00:16:33,130 --> 00:16:37,190
Musashi couldn't convert this perfect chance into a goal.

336
00:16:37,190 --> 00:16:38,960
Great, good job.

337
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,890
Now the game is ours.

338
00:16:41,810 --> 00:16:44,390
The captain is stopping the game now.

339
00:16:44,390 --> 00:16:47,620
Is Misugi, who can't get up from the ground, okay?

340
00:16:47,620 --> 00:16:48,270
Captain!

341
00:16:48,270 --> 00:16:49,600
Captain!

342
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,590
I'm fine.

343
00:16:50,590 --> 00:16:51,320
Misugi.

344
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:52,900
Did you score?

345
00:16:54,190 --> 00:16:55,910
We're sorry.

346
00:16:56,860 --> 00:16:58,410
Is that so?

347
00:16:58,410 --> 00:16:59,940
We can't let him play any longer!

348
00:16:59,940 --> 00:17:01,680
Nishiyama, get ready immediately!

349
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:02,250
Okay, Coach!

350
00:17:02,830 --> 00:17:05,750
Misugi is finally leaving the game.

351
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:09,750
He leaves the field with the help of his teammate.

352
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:11,630
Captain.

353
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:15,830
Jun-sama!

354
00:17:15,830 --> 00:17:16,720
Misugi!

355
00:17:19,050 --> 00:17:20,780
Do your best, guys!

356
00:17:20,780 --> 00:17:23,140
Only a few minutes are left.

357
00:17:23,750 --> 00:17:25,740
Don't give up, fight until the end!

358
00:17:25,740 --> 00:17:26,650
Absolutely!

359
00:17:29,630 --> 00:17:35,750
Misugi, the young noble of the field, quietly leaves the field.

360
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:38,530
He really put on a very good performance up to now.

361
00:17:38,530 --> 00:17:40,110
There goes Jun Misugi!

362
00:17:40,110 --> 00:17:41,370
Misugi...

363
00:17:43,730 --> 00:17:47,960
After Misugi entered the game, Musashi Middle School started playing very dominantly,

364
00:17:48,300 --> 00:17:51,640
But Toho's defense, led by Kitazume, fought well.

365
00:17:52,540 --> 00:17:55,080
Good. Don't take unnecessary risks.

366
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:57,260
Pass the ball and play for time.

367
00:17:57,260 --> 00:17:58,760
Understood.

368
00:17:58,760 --> 00:18:01,100
There's very little time left.

369
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:03,440
Musashi did everything they could.

370
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:04,520
Guys...

371
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,970
We won't give up!

372
00:18:07,970 --> 00:18:08,940
Hyuga!

373
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:11,520
Hyuga!

374
00:18:17,030 --> 00:18:19,110
And the final whistle of the match blows!

375
00:18:19,110 --> 00:18:19,790
We did it!

376
00:18:19,790 --> 00:18:24,200
Toho Academy will participate in the Traditional Tournament for the 3rd time!

377
00:18:28,250 --> 00:18:29,170
Nice.

378
00:18:31,520 --> 00:18:33,710
We were so close, Misugi.

379
00:18:33,710 --> 00:18:34,590
Yes.

380
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:40,330
I haven't been able to play against Tsubasa for 3 years.

381
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:45,520
The Tokyo tournament has ended.

382
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:48,980
Toho won the match 3-2.

383
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:50,610
By one goal, huh?

384
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:51,660
He narrowly won.

385
00:18:51,750 --> 00:18:52,940
3-2.

386
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:57,360
It seems Toho and Kojiro Hyuga will be our opponents again this year.

387
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:03,950
Coach Kitazume, we congratulate your victory.

388
00:19:03,950 --> 00:19:07,400
What is your current goal?

389
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:09,290
To be the champion of the traditional tournament, of course.

390
00:19:09,290 --> 00:19:13,670
With our current strength, I'm sure we'll beat Nankatsu.

391
00:19:13,670 --> 00:19:17,910
Sawada joining the team was really effective.

392
00:19:19,230 --> 00:19:21,200
Coach Kira.

393
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:26,010
You've become quite soft since I last saw you, Kojiro.

394
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:28,850
A championship flag, huh?

395
00:19:29,620 --> 00:19:32,670
I can't believe such things are enough to make you happy.

396
00:19:34,110 --> 00:19:38,360
You are a caged tiger that has deviated from its purpose!

397
00:19:41,420 --> 00:19:43,740
A tiger that has deviated from its purpose?

398
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:45,580
Exactly.

399
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:47,580
Do you understand, Kojiro?

400
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:50,710
You've become too soft since you came to Toho.

401
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:55,790
Even though you're on the field, you feel sorry for Misugi.

402
00:19:55,790 --> 00:20:00,190
The opposing team counter-attacked because of the ball you lost.

403
00:20:00,190 --> 00:20:03,370
And worst of all, you didn't even go back to defend.

404
00:20:05,850 --> 00:20:09,750
You won thanks to Wakashimazu's brilliant play.

405
00:20:09,770 --> 00:20:14,000
If it had been a draw, it would have been your fault.

406
00:20:15,270 --> 00:20:19,400
I don't remember teaching you this kind of football, Kojiro!

407
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:22,790
Cast aside your compassion and step onto the field!

408
00:20:22,790 --> 00:20:25,220
The only thing you need to possess is ruthlessness!

409
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:31,040
Even if you have to tear Misugi's heart apart to score a goal, you should do it.

410
00:20:34,040 --> 00:20:40,680
Since you joined Toho Academy, you haven't had to focus on anything other than football.

411
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:44,700
But I see that nothing is left

412
00:20:44,700 --> 00:20:48,390
of your spirit that once blazed with ambition.

413
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:51,220
You weren't like this before...

414
00:20:51,220 --> 00:20:55,650
You pushed everything aside to be strong despite all obstacles.

415
00:20:57,610 --> 00:20:59,030
The time has come.

416
00:20:59,030 --> 00:21:02,290
Even if I'm not here, do your training properly.

417
00:21:02,290 --> 00:21:04,030
Okay, Captain.

418
00:21:04,030 --> 00:21:06,700
KONAKA HOSPITAL

419
00:21:08,410 --> 00:21:09,950
Wakashimazu!

420
00:21:09,950 --> 00:21:11,310
Captain.

421
00:21:11,310 --> 00:21:13,790
You don't need to visit me.

422
00:21:13,790 --> 00:21:14,550
It's no trouble.

423
00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:17,210
I thought I'd drop it off while passing by.

424
00:21:17,940 --> 00:21:18,950
I'm counting on you.

425
00:21:18,950 --> 00:21:22,990
Make sure you recover by the time of the traditional tournament!

426
00:21:22,990 --> 00:21:23,920
Captain...

427
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:27,910
This is why everyone wanted your leadership.

428
00:21:28,560 --> 00:21:33,440
Takeshi and Wakashimazu followed you and joined Toho Academy.

429
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:37,980
But you are far from the qualities they followed you for right now.

430
00:21:37,980 --> 00:21:46,540
You will never be able to get close to Tsubasa Ozora, who fights for his dreams.

431
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:55,580
I opened a football school in Okinawa and I'm coaching there.

432
00:21:55,580 --> 00:22:00,840
If you don't want to be defeated by Tsubasa Ozora for the 3rd time...

433
00:22:00,840 --> 00:22:03,440
...the 4th time if you count elementary school

434
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:05,800
My door is open whenever you want to come.

435
00:22:11,630 --> 00:22:12,720
Hyuga.

436
00:22:12,720 --> 00:22:27,720
